# Day Tour (`day_tour1`)

Louvre timed-entry booking site for **Day Tour Paris**. Public marketing pages + embedded **Bokun** calendar widget. Team auth via **Neon Auth** (admin/manager/marketer). Tour copy and reviews are static TypeScript data.

## Stack

- **Next.js 16** App Router · **React 19** · **TypeScript** · **Tailwind CSS 4**
- Package manager: **pnpm** (`pnpm dev` / `pnpm build` / `pnpm lint`)
- Path alias: `@/*` → `./src/*`
- React Compiler enabled in `next.config.ts` (avoid unnecessary `useMemo`/`useCallback`)
- **framer-motion** — mobile nav animations
- **leaflet** — meeting-point map on home
- **react-icons** — icon set alongside local SVG icons in `src/components/icons.tsx`
- **Prisma 6** + **PostgreSQL (Neon)** — `@prisma/adapter-pg` + `pg`; client in `generated/prisma`, singleton in `src/lib/db.ts`

## Routes

| Path | Notes |
|------|--------|
| `/` | Home — banner, tour sections, booking sidebar in grid |
| `/about-us` | About page; booking sidebar **hidden** (still mounted) |
| `/blog`, `/blog/[slug]` | Static blog posts from `src/lib/blog-posts.ts` |
| `/reviews` | Filterable reviews from `src/lib/reviews-data.ts` |
| `/attraction-tours` | Tour listing from `src/lib/tour-schema.ts` |
| `/auth/sign-in` | Team login (no public sign-up) |
| `/admin/*` | Admin dashboard + user management (`admin` role) |
| `/manager/*` | Manager dashboard (`manager` role) |
| `/marketer/*` | Marketer dashboard (`marketer` role) |
| `/legal/*` | Linked in footer via `SITE.legal` — **routes not implemented yet** |

Route group `(public)` does not change URLs. Put future private/admin routes in new groups, e.g. `(auth)`, `(admin)`.

